{"ticker":"UPS","updated":"2026-10-30T23:20:12Z","profile":{"longName":"United Parcel Service, Inc.","shortName":"United Parcel Service, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ups.com","fullTimeEmployees":460000,"marketCap":92097101824,"trailingPE":20.120817,"forwardPE":13.386789,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0079799,"pegRatio":1.55,"targetMeanPrice":115.42308,"targetHighPrice":135.0,"targetLowPrice":76.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.067,"earningsGrowth":-0.116,"grossMargins":0.21382,"operatingMargins":0.07925,"profitMargins":0.0484,"totalRevenue":91367997440,"beta":1.046,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":122.41,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":90.84,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":6.11},"summary":"United Parcel Service, Inc., a package delivery and logistics provider, offers transportation and delivery services. It operates through two segments, U.S. Domestic Package and International Package. The U.S. Domestic Package segment offers time-definite delivery services for express letters, documents, packages and palletized freight through air and ground services. The International Package segment provides small package operations in Europe, the Middle East and Africa, Canada and Latin America, and Asia. The company offers a range of guaranteed day- and time-definite international transportation services; day-definite services; cross-border ground package delivery; contract-only, e-commerce solutions for non-urgent, and cross-border shipments; and international service for urgent and palletized shipments. It also provides international air and ocean freight forwarding, contract logistics, customs brokerage and insurance, mail services, healthcare logistics, distribution, and post-sales services. United Parcel Service, Inc. was founded in 1907 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"United Parcel Service, Inc. 是一家包裹遞送和物流供應商，提供運輸和遞送服務。它透過兩個部門運作：美國國內包裹和國際包裹。美國國內包裹部門透過空運和地面服務為快件、文件、包裹和托盤貨物提供限時遞送服務。國際包裹部門在歐洲、中東和非洲、加拿大和拉丁美洲以及亞洲提供小包裹業務。該公司提供一系列有保證的、限時的國際運輸服務；限日服務；跨境地麵包裹遞送；針對非緊急和跨境運輸的純合約電子商務解決方案；以及緊急和托盤運輸的國際服務。它還提供國際空運和海運代理、合約物流、報關和保險、郵件服務、醫療物流、配送和售後服務。 United Parcel Service, Inc. 成立於 1907 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"綜合貨運及物流","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":86.62,"h":86.85,"l":84.81,"c":85.23,"v":10058800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":85.37,"h":85.88,"l":84.78,"c":85.29,"v":7430900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":85.64,"h":85.69,"l":83.67,"c":84.48,"v":10741500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":84.61,"h":86.34,"l":84.19,"c":85.04,"v":8585400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":85.05,"h":85.05,"l":83.05,"c":84.32,"v":11783700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":84.23,"h":84.93,"l":84.05,"c":84.4,"v":7889700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":84.35,"h":85.17,"l":83.72,"c":83.85,"v":6684600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":82.43,"h":84.87,"l":82.0,"c":84.65,"v":10453500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":84.79,"h":85.02,"l":83.87,"c":84.35,"v":5545500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":84.87,"h":85.17,"l":83.91,"c":84.02,"v":6389000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":84.43,"h":85.35,"l":84.31,"c":85.2,"v":6185500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":85.07,"h":86.37,"l":83.73,"c":84.18,"v":9007000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":84.67,"h":85.09,"l":84.0,"c":85.05,"v":8067300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":85.11,"h":85.61,"l":84.01,"c":84.06,"v":18120200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":83.8,"h":85.7,"l":83.13,"c":84.23,"v":10224300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":84.47,"h":85.73,"l":84.12,"c":84.41,"v":7486300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":84.31,"h":85.02,"l":83.71,"c":83.9,"v":6988400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":83.8,"h":83.99,"l":82.36,"c":82.58,"v":9021100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":82.74,"h":83.88,"l":82.64,"c":83.72,"v":6845800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":83.93,"h":84.52,"l":83.46,"c":84.5,"v":7275300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":84.5,"h":84.55,"l":82.64,"c":83.53,"v":9876200},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":83.39,"h":84.6,"l":83.32,"c":84.38,"v":7074800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":84.67,"h":87.11,"l":84.54,"c":85.57,"v":9815500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":85.7,"h":