name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1090727/000162828026008432/ups-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"UPS, founded in 1907, is a global package delivery and logistics provider. We offer a broad range of industry-leading products and services through our extensive global presence, serving over 200 countries and territories. Our services include transportation and delivery through our integrated air and ground network, distribution, contract logistics, ocean freight, airfreight, customs brokerage and insurance. In 2025, we delivered an average of 20.8 million packages per day, totaling 5.2 billion packages during the year. Total revenue in 2025 was $88.7 billion.","zh":"UPS 成立於 1907 年，是一家全球包裹遞送和物流供應商。我們透過廣泛的全球業務提供廣泛的行業領先產品和服務，服務於 200 多個國家和地區。我們的服務包括透過我們的綜合空中和地面網路進行運輸和交付、分銷、合約物流、海運、空運、報關和保險。 2025年，我們平均每天遞送2,080萬件包裹，全年包裹總數達52億件。 2025 年總收入為 887 億美元。"},{"en":"We are continuing to execute our Customer First, People Led, Innovation Driven strategy, which focuses on growing in the parts of our market that value our end-to-end solutions, including healthcare, business-to-business (\"B2B\"), small- and medium-sized businesses (\"SMBs\"), and international.","zh":"我們將繼續執行客戶至上、以人為本、創新驅動的策略，並專注於重視我們端到端解決方案的市場部分的發展，包括醫療保健、企業對企業（「B2B」）、中小企業（「SMB」）和國際企業。"},{"en":"Customer First is about reducing friction in the customer experience by anticipating and solving for customers' needs. We are focused on providing differentiated value through our capabilities and service. We strive to enable our customers to better","zh":"客戶至上是指透過預測和解決客戶需求來減少客戶體驗中的摩擦。我們專注於透過我們的能力和服務提供差異化的價值。我們努力讓我們的客戶更好"}],"markets":[{"en":"We have two reporting segments: U.S. Domestic Package and International Package. Our remaining businesses are reported as Supply Chain Solutions (\"SCS\"). U.S. Domestic Package and International Package are together referred to as our global small package operations.","zh":"我們有兩個報告部分：美國國內包裹和國際包裹。我們的其餘業務被報告為供應鏈解決方案（“SCS”）。美國國內小包和國際小包統稱為我們的全球小包業務。"},{"en":"Our global small package operations provide time-definite delivery services for express letters, documents, packages and palletized freight via air and ground services. These services are supported by numerous shipping, visibility and billing technologies including our Digital Access Program (\"DAP\"), which embeds our shipping solutions directly into leading e-commerce platforms, enabling us to reach SMBs and e-commerce markets more broadly.","zh":"我们的全球小包裹业务通过空运和地面服务为快件、文件、包裹和托盘货物提供限时递送服务。這些服務得到眾多運輸、可見性和計費技術的支持，包括我們的數位存取計劃（「DAP」），該計劃將我們的運輸解決方案直接嵌入到領先的電子商務平台中，使我們能夠更廣泛地覆蓋中小型企業和電子商務市場。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Building and maintaining long-term customer relationships through superior service is a competitive strength of UPS. In 2025, we served 1.6 million shipping customers and more than 10.7 million delivery recipients daily. In 2025, one customer, Amazon.com, Inc. and its affiliates, represented approximately 10.6% of our consolidated revenues, substantially all of which was within our U.S. Domestic Package segment. As previously disclosed, our strategy involves reducing volumes from this customer by more than 50% by June 2026 from 2024 levels. For additional information on the operational and financial impacts arising from these actions, see \"Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations\". For additional information on this and other customers, see \"Risk Factors - Business and Operating Risks - Changes in our relationships with any of our significant ","zh":"透過優質的服務建立和維持長期的客戶關係是 UPS 的競爭優勢。 2025 年，我們每天為 160 萬運輸客戶和超過 1,070 萬收件人提供服務。 2025 年，Amazon.com, Inc. 及其附屬公司這一客戶約占我們合併收入的 10.6%，其中大部分收入都在我們的美國國內包裹業務領域。如同先前所揭露的，我們的策略包括到 2026 年 6 月將該客戶的銷售量從 2024 年的水準減少 50% 以上。有關這些行動所產生的運營和財務影響的更多資訊，請參閱“管理層對財務狀況和運營結果的討論和分析”。有關該客戶和其他客戶的更多資訊，請參閱“風險因素 - 業務和運營風險 - 我們與任何重要客戶的關係的變化"},{"en":"We offer a broad array of transportation and logistics services and compete with many local, regional, national and international logistics providers as well as national postal services. We believe our strategy, network and competitive strengths position us well to compete in the marketplace. For additional information on our competitive environment, see \"Risk Factors - Business and Operating Risks - Our industry continues to rapidly evolve. We expect to continue to face significant competition, which could materially adversely affect us\".","zh":"我們提供廣泛的運輸和物流服務，並與許多本地、區域、國家和國際物流提供者以及國家郵政服務競爭。我们相信我们的战略、网络和竞争优势使我们能够在市场竞争中占据有利地位。有關我們競爭環境的更多資訊，請參閱“風險因素 - 業務和運營風險 - 我們的行業繼續快速發展。我們預計將繼續面臨激烈的競爭，這可能會對我們產生重大不利影響”。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We offer a broad array of transportation and logistics services and compete with many local, regional, national and international logistics providers as well as national postal services. We believe our strategy, network and competitive strengths position us well to compete in the marketplace. For additional information on our competitive environment, see \"Risk Factors - Business and Operating Risks - Our industry continues to rapidly evolve. We expect to continue to face significant competition, which could materially adversely affect us\".","zh":"我们提供广泛的运输和物流服务，并与许多本地、区域、国家和国际物流提供商以及国家邮政服务竞争。我們相信我們的策略、網路和競爭優勢使我們能夠在市場競爭中佔據有利地位。有關我們競爭環境的更多資訊，請參閱“風險因素 - 業務和運營風險 - 我們的行業繼續快速發展。我們預計將繼續面臨激烈的競爭，這可能會對我們產生重大不利影響”。"},{"en":"We are subject to numerous laws and regulations in the countries in which we operate. Continued compliance with increasingly stringent laws, regulations and policies in the U.S. and in the other countries in which we operate may result in materially increased costs, or we could be subject to substantial fines or possible revocation of our authority to conduct our operations.","zh":"我们遵守业务所在国家的众多法律和法规。繼續遵守美國和我們開展業務的其他國家/地區日益嚴格的法律、法規和政策可能會導致成本大幅增加，或者我們可能會受到巨額罰款或可能被撤銷開展業務的權限。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"U.S.Domestic Package","val":59519000000,"zh":"美國國內包裹部門"},{"name":"International","val":18576000000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":88661000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":67432000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":21229000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":88661000000}},"peers":["FDX","TGT","PEP","MMM","CAT"]}}